+# MASTER7 v152 918KISS catalogue safety release
+
+Release: `17.0.0-selfbuilt.152-918kiss-catalogue-safety`
+
+This release hardens the three isolated 918KISS H5 catalogue profiles:
+
+- Normal MYR
+- Normal MY1
+- Free MYR
+
+The portal rejects a profile refresh when normalization removes a malformed or
+duplicate row, retaining the last complete snapshot. A missing supplier
+availability field is treated as maintenance and is shown as suspended rather
+than active.
+
+The release keeps all 918KISS games non-playable. The supplier-specific player,
+launch, wallet, transfer-status, exit, settlement and recovery contracts have
+not been supplied or accepted. MY1 1:100 remains an internal candidate setting,
+not a verified supplier money contract.
+
+Payment providers, payment switches, production game switches, credentials,
+service plans and DNS are unchanged.
